Package: HowMaHiCo
Title: LC-Immunopeptidomics QC Reporting Workflow
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("David", "Gomez-Zepeda", , "davidgz.science@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9467-1213"))
Description: Ingests LC-MS search-engine output (FragPipe, DIA-NN, PEAKS) for
    LC-immunopeptidomics (MHC/HLA peptide) experiments, normalizes it into one
    unified long-format peptide table, and renders self-contained interactive
    HTML QC reports plus csv/xlsx/png result exports via a parameterized
    RMarkdown template.
